{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y4aLKzAhQou6oLrYgivSur","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"free video calling app no sign up no registration 2024 2025\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Video chat with a stranger for free & no registration needed | IncogChats\",\"url\":\"https://www.incogchats.com/video-chat-with-stranger\"},{\"title\":\"20 Best Free Video Calling Apps in 2025 - Complete Guide\",\"url\":\"https://justalk.com/blog/list-of-free-video-calling-apps.html\"},{\"title\":\"Online video calls in browser for free - Videolink2me\",\"url\":\"https://videolink2me.com/start\"},{\"title\":\"FlippyTalk | Omegle Alternative for Free Random Video Chat\",\"url\":\"https://flippytalk.com/\"},{\"title\":\"5 Text, Voice, and Video Call Web Apps That Need No Registration\",\"url\":\"https://www.makeuseof.com/tag/text-voice-video-call-apps-without-registration/\"},{\"title\":\"Who - Live Random Video Chat\",\"url\":\"https://whoapp.live/\"},{\"title\":\"Omega: Free Omegle Alternative to Chat with Strangers\",\"url\":\"https://www.omega.app/\"},{\"title\":\"Video Call App without Phone Number 2024 | Blowing Ideas\",\"url\":\"https://www.blowingideas.com/video-call-app-without-phone-number/\"},{\"title\":\"HOLLA: Free Live Video Chat App to Meet Real People\",\"url\":\"https://www.holla.world/\"},{\"title\":\"The 10 best free video calling apps of 2025\",\"url\":\"https://www.ringcentral.com/us/en/blog/free-video-calling/\"}]\n\nBased on my search, here are several free video calling apps and services that don't require sign-up or registration:\n\n## No Registration Required Options\n\n### **Videolink2me**\nNo registration needed. To start chatting with friends just send them link and enjoy video call in browser. Use Videolink2me for online video calls.\n\n### **IncogChats**\nVideo chat with thousands of strangers online, all across the world on the no.1 website and app, IncogChats for free no need for registration & login.\n\n### **Who App**\nRandom video chat with people all around the world. Only verified profiles and no sign up needed! Join us now.\n\n### **JumpChat**\nJumpChat is one of the simplest methods for making free video calls online without registering.\n\n### **WebRoom** (Limited)\nWebRoom provides a registration-free online video call with one caveat: you are only given a trial room that lasts for 20 minutes. WebRoom will attempt to prompt you to create a trial account after 20 minutes.(no content)You can, however, easily rebuild the room under a different email address and continue any communication if necessary.\n\n### **FlippyTalk**\nFlippyTalk is the best Omegle alternative for random video chats. Meet strangers worldwide through free, anonymous 1-on-1 video calls and make new friends.\n\n## Browser-Based Options (No App Install Needed)\n\n### **Livestorm**\nJust like Google Meet, Livestorm doesn't require you to install a desktop app. You can make your meetings accessible from any browser on any device.(no content)Its free Basic plan includes all features, unlimited meetings, one meeting room, up to four participants per meeting, and an option to schedule meetings in advance. Unfortunately, the scheduled meetings allow you to add only four participants per meeting for up to 20 minutes.\n\n### **Messenger Rooms** (Partial)\nMessenger Rooms does require registration. Unfortunately, the first room creator must have a Facebook or Messenger account. However, others can join the video chat without requiring a Facebook account by inputting a username and joining the call.\n\nThese options provide various ways to make free video calls without the hassle of creating accounts, with Videolink2me and JumpChat being particularly straightforward for quick, registration-free video calling.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9a7bf39e-4091-474e-b8f1-7183a43